<title>UK: AHB sets 1.0 bln mark jumbo Pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>AHB sets 1.0 bln mark jumbo Pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers CSFB, Commerzbank, Deutsche Bank and Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG (AHB)</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     3.50	MATURITY    13.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.0875   PAY DATE    13.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  18.75 BP  REOFFER    98.95     SPREAD	+7 BP</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  13.75 BP  GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 482</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
